    <Placemark><name>Ogan</name><styleUrl>#placed_by_the_team</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>69 households</b>, zone 7b, ward 1,2<br/>road-served (walk to road <= 2.5 km)<br/>1.48 km by road to Afore<br/>position: placed by the team<br/>placed by the team, 8.3 km from the guess<br/><b>destroyed by fire 2026-10-04 reported by Will: 'It was Ogan Village and now burned to the ground' Ogan is counted in outputs/access/ as 69 households, road-served, 1.48 km by road to Afore. That is 2.6% of the 2,703 road-served households and 1.8% of the 3,837 total. Whether those households have re</b>]]></description><Point><coordinates>148.397190,-9.132630,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
